## Performance Optimization

### SQLite
- **Write-Ahead Logging (WAL)**: Enable for concurrent reads during writes
- **Indexes**: Timeline ID, session ID, event timestamp
- **VACUUM**: Periodic optimization
- **Batch Inserts**: Use transactions for multiple events

### dbt-DuckDB
- **Incremental Models**: Only process new events
- **Partitioning**: By timeline_id for large datasets
- **Materialized Views**: For frequently accessed aggregations
- **Column Pruning**: Select only needed columns in sources

## Anti-Patterns to Prevent

❌ **Mutable Events**: Never UPDATE game_events, only INSERT
❌ **Missing Transactions**: Always wrap multi-insert operations
❌ **Blocking dbt Runs**: Run analytics refresh async, not in game loop
❌ **No Tests**: All dbt models must have schema tests
❌ **Hardcoded SQL**: Use dbt macros for reusable calculations
❌ **Skipping Incremental**: Use incremental materialization for real-time data

## Success Metrics

- Event writes < 10ms (p95)
- dbt incremental runs < 5 seconds
- Analytics queries < 100ms
- 100% test coverage on dbt models
- Zero data loss on crashes (ACID guarantees)
